	quest.1BAFDA330E991BEC.quest_desc: ["For the next step you'll need reinforced paper, but sugarcane can be hard to find on the islands. Luckily, that axe and cutting board can strip logs, and the tree bark left behind can be made into paper. Combined with the other parts, you've got reinforced paper. All you'll need after that are a couple of whiskers..."]
