	quest.7B23C933D76458BA.quest_desc: ["Run a Chromatic Singularity through an Item Drain to extract Chromatic Compound. The leftover Lumisene burns as a light source, handy for turning the compound into Refined Radiance; drop it into the void for Shadow Steel."]
