	quest.7C26B21C40608612.quest_desc: ["Laboring with one's flesh is unbecoming for a Daemon. And worse, it's inefficient. But you need materials to build your machines in the first place. Swallow your pride for now, and gather some base metals. Just remember to clear your cookies after."]
